{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Td2NnY8Cz8fuTqjevW69FV","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Huang 1998 \"empirical mode decomposition\" \"Hilbert spectrum\" \"new method\" Proc Royal Society DOI\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"The empirical mode decomposition and the Hilbert spectrum for nonlinear and non-stationary time series analysis | Proceedings A | The Royal Society\",\"url\":\"https://royalsocietypublishing.org/doi/10.1098/rspa.1998.0193\"},{\"title\":\"(PDF) The empirical mode decomposition and the Hilbert spectrum for nonlinear and non-stationary time series analysis\",\"url\":\"https://www.researchgate.net/publication/215754718_The_empirical_mode_decomposition_and_the_Hilbert_spectrum_for_nonlinear_and_non-stationary_time_series_analysis\"},{\"title\":\"Huang, N.E., Shen, Z., Long, S.R., et al. (1998) The Empirical Mode Decomposition and the Hilbert Spectrum for Nonlinear and Non-Stationary Time Series Analysis. Proceedings of the Royal Society of London A Mathematical, Physical and Engineering Sciences, The Royal Society, 903-995. - References - Scientific Research Publishing\",\"url\":\"https://www.scirp.org/reference/referencespapers?referenceid=2096567\"},{\"title\":\"[PDF] The empirical mode decomposition and the Hilbert spectrum for nonlinear and non-stationary time series analysis | Semantic Scholar\",\"url\":\"https://www.semanticscholar.org/paper/The-empirical-mode-decomposition-and-the-Hilbert-Huang-Shen/3842d81b0375dae8ae92734aa2a5d4aeed7a91d1\"},{\"title\":\"11.1 CEEMD - Spectral Decomposition\",\"url\":\"https://doc.opendtect.org/7.0.0/doc/od_userdoc/content/appendix_a-attributes_and_filters/ceemd-spectral_decomposition.htm\"},{\"title\":\"Method for Mode Mixing Separation in Empirical Mode Decomposition\",\"url\":\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/1709.05547\"},{\"title\":\"The empirical mode decomposition and the Hilbert ...\",\"url\":\"https://hal.science/hal-04014501v1/file/huang1998.pd