{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01HcQdxx4Nh2gYQfDWEE5BsU","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Wu Huang 2004 \"study of the characteristics of white noise using the empirical mode\" DOI Proc Royal Society\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"A New Ensemble Empirical Mode Decomposition (EEMD) Denoising Method for Seismic Signals - ScienceDirect\",\"url\":\"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S1876610216309729\"},{\"title\":\"A study of the characteristics of white noise using the empirical mode decomposition method - ADS\",\"url\":\"https://ui.adsabs.harvard.edu/abs/2004RSPSA.460.1597W/abstract\"},{\"title\":\"Gaussian Noise Filtering from ECG by Wiener Filter and Ensemble Empirical Mode Decomposition | Journal of Signal Processing Systems | Springer Nature Link\",\"url\":\"https://link.springer.com/article/10.1007/s11265-009-0447-z\"},{\"title\":\"Modern Time-Series and Spectral Methods for Analyzing Solar and Stellar Oscillatory Signals\",\"url\":\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2606.07966\"},{\"title\":\"(PDF) Complementary Ensemble Empirical Mode Decomposition: a Novel Noise Enhanced Data Analysis Method.\",\"url\":\"https://www.researchgate.net/publication/220531136_Complementary_Ensemble_Empirical_Mode_Decomposition_a_Novel_Noise_Enhanced_Data_Analysis_Method\"},{\"title\":\"Relevant modes selection method based on Spearman correlation coefficient for laser signal denoising using empirical mode decomposition | Optical Review | Springer Nature Link\",\"url\":\"https://link.springer.com/article/10.1007/s10043-016-0275-x\"},{\"title\":\"[PDF] Ensemble Empirical Mode Decomposition: a Noise-Assisted Data Analysis Method | Semantic Scholar\",\"url\":\"https://www.semanticscholar.org/paper/Ensemble-Empirical-Mode-Decomposition:-a-Data-Wu-Huang/a97ee1d4a15c04160c323bd650e9cb9dff9dfced\"},{\"title\":\"(PDF) A study of the characteristics of white noise using the empirical mode decomposition method\",\"url\":\