{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01HLnfRobp8GP2zw8uaAhJPW","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Boudraa Cexus 2007 \"EMD-based signal filtering\" IEEE Transactions Instrumentation Measurement DOI 10.1109\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"(PDF) EMD-Based signal filtering\",\"url\":\"https://www.researchgate.net/publication/220409465_EMD-Based_signal_filtering\"},{\"title\":\"(PDF) REPRINTED FROM: IEEE TRANSACTIONS ON INSTRUMENTATION AND MEASURMENT 1 EMD-based Filtering using Similarity Measure Between Probability Density Functions of IMFs *\",\"url\":\"https://www.academia.edu/4720953/REPRINTED_FROM_IEEE_TRANSACTIONS_ON_INSTRUMENTATION_AND_MEASURMENT_1_EMD_based_Filtering_using_Similarity_Measure_Between_Probability_Density_Functions_of_IMFs_\"},{\"title\":\"EMD-CPO-GRU-based Transformer Oil Temperature Prediction | Journal of Computer Science and Artificial Intelligence\",\"url\":\"https://jocsai.com/index.php/jcsai/article/view/36\"},{\"title\":\"Portfolio Selection Based on EMD Denoising with Correlation Coefficient Test Criterion\",\"url\":\"https://ouci.dntb.gov.ua/en/works/4zeDWBr7/\"},{\"title\":\"Portfolio Selection Based on EMD Denoising with Correlation Coefficient Test Criterion | Computational Economics | Springer Nature Link\",\"url\":\"https://link.springer.com/article/10.1007/s10614-022-10345-4\"},{\"title\":\"Signal Processing: An International Journal (SPIJ)\",\"url\":\"https://cscjournals.org/download/issuearchive/SPIJ/Volume5/SPIJ_V5_I3.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"[PDF] EMD-Based Signal Filtering | Semantic Scholar\",\"url\":\"https://www.semanticscholar.org/paper/EMD-Based-Signal-Filtering-Boudraa-Cexus/e4d3324e318ed6531ebe8d0d03b0fbe94ad6fba3\"},{\"title\":\"Feature extraction method of pipeline signal based on parameter optimized vocational mode decomposition and exponential entropy - Yina Zhou, Yong Zhang, Jingyi Lu, Fan Yang, Hongli Dong, Gongfa Li, 2022\",\"url\":\"https://journals.sagepub.com/doi/abs/10.1177/01423312211029440\"}]\n\nI found the paper you're looking for. Here are the details:\n\n**Authors:** A.-O. Boudraa & J.-C. Cexus\n\n**Title:** EMD-based signal filtering\n\n**Publication:** IEEE Transactions on Instrumentation and Measurement\n\n**Volume/Issue:** 56(6)\n\n**Pages:** 2196–2202\n\n**Year:** 2007\n\n**DOI:** 10.1109/TIM.2007.907967\n\nThe paper proposes \"a signal-filtering method based on empirical mode decomposition\" where \"the filtering method is a fully data-driven approach\" and \"a noisy signal is adaptively decomposed into intrinsic oscillatory components called intrinsic mode functions (IMFs) by means of an algorithm referred to as a sifting process.\"\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9958eae5-5a95-4e8c-919f-b61a93167db8","uuid":"8b314165-95c8-4f39-b070-607e31f6c555","timestamp":"2026-07-06T20:46:09.237Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"Boudraa Cexus 2007 \"EMD-based signal filtering\" IEEE Transactions Instrumentation Measurement DOI 10.1109","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01FmMLJ5CX4t68suF2iLvsm5","content":[{"title":"(PDF) EMD-Based signal filtering","url":"https://www.researchgate.net/publication/220409465_EMD-Based_signal_filtering"},{"title":"(PDF) REPRINTED FROM: IEEE TRANSACTIONS ON INSTRUMENTATION AND MEASURMENT 1 EMD-based Filtering using Similarity Measure Between Probability Density Functions of IMFs *","url":"https://www.academia.edu/4720953/REPRINTED_FROM_IEEE_TRANSACTIONS_ON_INSTRUMENTATION_AND_MEASURMENT_1_EMD_based_Filtering_using_Similarity_Measure_Between_Probability_Density_Functions_of_IMFs_"},{"title":"EMD-CPO-GRU-based Transformer Oil Temperature Prediction | Journal of Computer Science and Artificial Intelligence","url":"https://jocsai.com/index.php/jcsai/article/view/36"},{"title":"Portfolio Selection Based on EMD Denoising with Correlation Coefficient Test Criterion","url":"https://o